# My Readiness

Farmer-facing KaLI Coop portal: public, no-login mobile PWA + thin Express BFF.
Lookup by member number, phone, or national ID. Stateless per visit.

## This repo owns

- Display-ready readiness UI (Score / Actions / Advisory)
- Localization (en, sw; more later via i18n keys — never hardcode copy)
- Action self-report forwarding
- Kali voice greeting playback for the selected locale

## This repo does NOT own

- Scoring, Neo4j, or action ranking — call the core platform internal API
- Officer / field-verification tooling
- Auth or sessions

## Architecture

Frontend → this backend (`/api/readiness/...`) → core platform (`/internal/...`).
Never talk to Neo4j or any DB from this service. Shape and localize only.

Until `CORE_PLATFORM_API_URL` is set, use the mock client in
`my-readiness/backend/src/clients/corePlatform.js`. Do not invent a local scoring algorithm.

## Product rules

- Self-report does **not** change the score. Copy must say so.
- Verified = officer confirmed; pending = self-reported or not yet confirmed.
- Mobile-first, thumb-sized targets, bottom tab nav, skeleton loaders, cache last profile.

See `my-readiness/PROJECT.md` for API contracts and screen list.
